.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-backup-space-reset-password - Reset the SFTP password


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro backup-space reset-password  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Reset the SFTP password

.PP
Creates a new random password and returns it once. The old password stops working at once and open SFTP sessions are closed; update your backup jobs. \fB"confirm": true\fR required. 409 \fBnot_actionable\fR when the space is not active; 502 \fBbackend_unavailable\fR = try again in a few minutes.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/backup-spaces/{id}/password (operationId resetBackupSpacePassword, scope services_write)


